# Conformance probe pack for `until:` in a UPER pack (spec 0.22, ruling 26;
# spec 0.19). Public. No kinds. The terminated text is read at the cursor,
# with no alignment, between two constrained whole numbers.
#
#   x      INTEGER (0..5): 3 bits
#   label  8-bit characters up to NUL, from bit 3
#   y      INTEGER (10..13): 2 bits, the value minus 10
#
# The message is padded with zero bits to a whole octet (0.19, Encode).
format     conformance-long-uper
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
encoding   uper
field   probe.x      int:0:5    uint
field   probe.label  until:0    chars:ascii8
field   probe.y      int:10:13  uint
